{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國人氣男星添麥菲查洛美（Timothee Chalamet）今年初飛抵內地宣傳新作《Marty Supreme：癲造之才》（Marty Supreme），宣傳期間的他到處觀光之餘亦與當地人士打乒乓球及籃球切磋球技。</p><p>而近日網上就流傳一條添麥</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:23:54.620587+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.674956+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.674956+00:00","content_hash":"f463c0bede2b8f8a6347eada15d102f47d489e35c2b5595fc1789bf53697a803","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}